          "domain": "standard-english-conventions",
          "skill": "form-structure-and-sense",
          "passage": "Astrophysicist Wanda Diaz Merced, who works with the International Astronomical Union's Office of Astronomy for Development, develops methods that translate astronomical time-series into sound. Her techniques for analyzing space-physics data through hearing rather than vision ______ frequently cited in studies of accessible science, in part because they have helped sighted researchers detect features that are easy to miss in conventional visual displays.",
