          "passage": "Archaeologist Akinwumi Ogundiran, in his 2020 study *The Yoruba: A New History*, presents a feature of the early urban settlements he documents that earlier scholarship had largely overlooked ______ many of the precolonial Yoruba towns he describes were enclosed by extensive earthen walls, structures whose surveyed lengths run for tens of kilometers around individual communities.",
