          "skill": "form-structure-and-sense",
          "passage": "The legal scholar Kimberlé Crenshaw introduced the term *intersectionality* in a 1989 essay to describe how categories such as race and gender, when considered separately, can fail to capture the experiences of people who occupy more than one of them at once. Each of the three legal cases Crenshaw analyzes in that essay ______ a different facet of the framework she is proposing.",
